  "termsAndConditions": "I hereby declare that the article(s) pledged above belong to me and are free from any encumbrance. I agree to repay the principal amount with interest at the rate stated above within the time agreed for redemption. I understand that the pledge shall be redeemable within the period agreed and during the days of grace as provided under applicable law.",
